       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CLCTPCTB.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CALCULATED-FIELDS.
           05 CHG-AMT            PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 TEMP-DIFFERENCE    PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05 TEMP-FORMATTED     PIC zz,z99.99-.

       01 WS-CUST-INFO.
           05 WS-CUST-NUM           PIC 9(5).
           05 WS-CUST-NAME          PIC X(20).
           05 WS-SALES-THIS-YTD     PIC S9(5)V9(2).
           05 WS-SALES-LAST-YTD     PIC S9(5)V9(2).

        01 WS-MAX-FIELDS.
           05 WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR         PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR-NAME    PIC X(20).
           05 WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR         PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR-NAME    PIC X(20).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-CUST-INFO.
           05 LS-CUST-NUM           PIC 9(5).
           05 LS-CUST-NAME          PIC X(20).
           05 LS-SALES-THIS-YTD     PIC S9(5)V9(2).
           05 LS-SALES-LAST-YTD     PIC S9(5)V9(2).

       01 LS-MAX-FIELDS.
           05 LS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR         PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 LS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR-NAME    PIC X(20).
           05 LS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR         PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 LS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR-NAME    PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION using LS-CUST-INFO
                                LS-MAX-FIELDS.

           DISPLAY "BEGIN CLCTPCTB PROGRAM".

           MOVE LS-CUST-INFO to WS-CUST-INFO.
           MOVE LS-MAX-FIELDS to WS-MAX-FIELDS.

      * PERFORM CALCUATION OF TOP VALUES
           MOVE WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR to TEMP-FORMATTED.
           DISPLAY "CURRENT HIGHEST SALES: " TEMP-FORMATTED.

           IF WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR < WS-SALES-THIS-YTD
                MOVE WS-SALES-THIS-YTD TO WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR
                MOVE WS-CUST-NAME TO WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR-NAME.

           MOVE WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "NEW HIGEST SALES: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
           MOVE WS-SALES-THIS-YTD TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "SALES this year: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
           MOVE WS-SALES-LAST-YTD TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "SALES last year: " TEMP-FORMATTED.

           SUBTRACT WS-SALES-LAST-YTD FROM WS-SALES-THIS-YTD
                GIVING TEMP-DIFFERENCE.

           MOVE TEMP-DIFFERENCE TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "DIFFERENCE in SALES: " TEMP-FORMATTED.

           IF WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR < TEMP-DIFFERENCE
                    MOVE TEMP-DIFFERENCE TO WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR
                    MOVE WS-CUST-NAME TO WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR-NAME.

      * CHANGE THE WS-MAX-FIELDS To LS-MAX-FIELDS to introduce an error
           MOVE WS-MAX-FIELDS to LS-MAX-FIELDS.

           DISPLAY "END CLCTPCTB PROGRAM".

           EXIT.